  "bio": "Randy Lee, based in Houston, United States, is an award-winning tattoo artist recognized for his exceptional illustrative style. His professionalism shines through not only in the stunning quality of his tattoos but also in his methodical approach to maintaining a clean and hygienic studio environment. To book an appointment with Randy, clients are encouraged to reach out via email, as he ensures all interactions are handled with utmost attention and efficiency.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Houston, Texas, United States\n\nTX Artist- I paint stuff & junk & things. @uponthepoint for my tattoo portfolio.\n Link below to book me or my team. 💙🇺🇸💙",
